#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:1
msgid "Huangpu financing and credit product directory"
msgstr "黄浦融资信用产品目录"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:4
msgid "Loan | Huangpu"
msgstr "贷款｜黄浦区"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:6
msgid "Published directory; lender review"
msgstr "目录已公布，须贷款方审核"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:8
msgid ""
"`Evidence S128 <https://xydhp.shhuangpu.gov.cn/finance-product>`_. "
"黄浦区融资信用服务平台-银行产品."
msgstr "`证据 S128 <https://xydhp.shhuangpu.gov.cn/finance-product>`_. 黄浦区融资信用服务平台-银行产品."

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:10
msgid "Amount and mechanism"
msgstr "额度与机制"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:13
msgid ""
"Product-specific bank credit, startup guarantee and IP-backed finance"
msgstr "各银行授信、创业担保与知识产权融资产品条件各异"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:15
msgid "No equity; repayable"
msgstr "不占股，须偿还"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:17
msgid "Eligibility and timing"
msgstr "资格与时间"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:20
msgid ""
"Select the actual bank product on the official district platform. Credit "
"eligibility, guarantee, rates, fees, collateral and repayment depend on "
"the lender and company; the directory is not an approval."
msgstr "在区级官方平台选择具体银行产品，授信资格、担保、利率、费用、抵押及还款依银行与企业确定，列入目录不代表获批。"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:22
msgid "Product-specific; confirm current lender terms"
msgstr "依具体产品，核验贷款方现行条件"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:24
msgid "Contact and application"
msgstr "联系与申请"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:27
msgid ""
"`Official application / policy route "
"<https://xydhp.shhuangpu.gov.cn/finance-product>`_"
msgstr "`官方申请／政策入口 <https://xydhp.shhuangpu.gov.cn/finance-product>`_"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:29
msgid ""
"The linked authority or operator is the contact route. A direct current "
"program contact is not established in this profile."
msgstr "请通过所链主管部门或运营方联系，本档案未核实现任项目直接联系人。"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:31
msgid ""
"Editorial application checklist. The current official notice or agreement "
"controls the actual procedure."
msgstr "编辑申请清单，实际流程以现行官方通知或协议为准。"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:33
msgid ""
"Select the current bank or public guarantee product and check borrower "
"eligibility."
msgstr "选择现行银行或公共担保产品，核验借款资格。"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:35
msgid ""
"Prepare accounts, cash-flow forecast, ownership and requested security "
"documents."
msgstr "准备报表、现金流预测、股权及要求的担保材料。"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:37
msgid ""
"Complete lender and guarantee assessment; compare all costs and repayment "
"terms."
msgstr "完成贷款及担保评估，比较全部成本与还款条件。"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:39
msgid ""
"Sign and track debt service; claim interest support only if independently "
"eligible."
msgstr "签约并管理偿债，贴息须另行符合资格。"

#: ../../funding/huangpu-credit-directory.rst:41
msgid ""
"The published maximum is a ceiling, not an entitlement. Check the "
"applicable notice, eligible cost period, other public support and written "
"payment conditions."
msgstr "公布最高额为上限，不构成当然权益。须核验适用通知、合资格支出期间、其他财政资助及书面拨付条件。"
